{"ID":"20240206113951-0erbjve","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206113951-0erbjve","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113951-0erbjve\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114002-eq8ulfd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113955-da2vnas\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206114002-eq8ulfd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:178,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:178\u0026#125;","title":"桑枝","type":"doc","updated":"20240902092845"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206114002-eq8ulfd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206114002-eq8ulfd","updated":"20240206114005"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产安徽、江苏、浙江、湖南、四川等地。\n【性状】\t干燥的嫩枝呈长圆柱形，长短不一，直径0.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"lcm。外表灰黄色或灰褐色，有多数谈褐色小点状皮孔及细纵纹，并可见灰白色半月形的叶痕和棕黄色的叶芽。质坚韧，有弹性，较难折断，断面黄白色，纤维性。斜片呈椭圆形，长约2mm。切面皮部较薄，木部黄白色，射纹细密，中心有细小而绵软的髓。有青草气，味淡略粘。\n【性味】\t苦，平。\n【功效】\t祛风湿，利关节，行水气。主治风寒湿痹，四肢拘挛，脚气浮肿，肌体风痒。\n【炙品】\t炒桑枝：桑枝片用文火炒至淡黄色晾凉入药者。\n炙桑枝：净桑枝片拌麦麸用文火炒至深黄色，筛去麸皮，晾凉入药者。\n酒桑枝：称酒炒桑枝。为桑枝片用酒淋洒，微闷，待吸干，再用文火炒至微黄入药者。增强祛风通络之功。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113955-da2vnas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113955-da2vnas","updated":"20240206113955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113955-kfhsr02.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715133106-xsnnywi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715133106-xsnnywi","updated":"20240715133106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 303px;","style":"width: 293px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626080936-m9m5h49.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 293px;\" parent-style=\"width: 303px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 371px;","style":"width: 361px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑葚"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑葚-20240715131939-gxk77fp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 361px;\" parent-style=\"width: 371px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 528px;","style":"width: 518px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221194320-jduqpx8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 518px;\" parent-style=\"width: 528px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715133106-0njn4oo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715133106-0njn4oo","updated":"20240715133106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 487px;","style":"width: 477px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626081922-orlrph9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 477px;\" parent-style=\"width: 487px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626081913-z56swor.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715133106-0nlzwil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715133106-0nlzwil","updated":"20240715133106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 363px;","style":"width: 353px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑葚 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑葚 3-20240715132335-e6djm1v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 353px;\" parent-style=\"width: 363px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑葚 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑葚 2-20240715132151-l3gw36y.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 400px;\" parent-style=\"width: 410px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑葚 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑葚 1-20240715132109-37eakvq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 400px;\" parent-style=\"width: 410px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715133106-q2zoh0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715133106-q2zoh0y","updated":"20240715133106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 368px;","style":"width: 358px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑葚 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑葚 4-20240715132550-goqmo7h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 358px;\" parent-style=\"width: 368px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 815px;","style":"width: 805px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑葚 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑葚 5-20240715132701-el4fje4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 805px;\" parent-style=\"width: 815px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715133106-bi3nkp0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715133106-bi3nkp0","updated":"20240715133106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 666px;","style":"width: 656px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626081624-o3gs902.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 656px;\" parent-style=\"width: 666px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 580px;","style":"width: 570px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626081527-rvkifua.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 570px;\" parent-style=\"width: 580px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715133106-nnaotdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715133106-nnaotdq","updated":"20240715133106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 752px;","style":"width: 742px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑葚 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑葚 7-20240715132928-u3xsjds.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 742px;\" parent-style=\"width: 752px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 397px;","style":"width: 387px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626081425-wipp1mb.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 387px;\" parent-style=\"width: 397px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715133106-5xv1mu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715133106-5xv1mu4","updated":"20240715133106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 732px;","style":"width: 722px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑葚 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑葚 6-20240715132749-l90vlid.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 722px;\" parent-style=\"width: 732px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 432px;","style":"width: 422px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626081328-z2wkq85.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 422px;\" parent-style=\"width: 432px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715133109-y0akt3e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240715133109-y0akt3e"}},{"ID":"20240902092837-vrwpncd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-vrwpncd","updated":"20240902092845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：桑枝"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-ng06g1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-ng06g1u","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑枝《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-ryiu25z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-ryiu25z","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】SānɡZhī"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-jechbms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-jechbms","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】RAMULUSMORI"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-919i8fo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-919i8fo","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为桑科植物桑MorusalbaL.的干燥嫩枝。春末夏初采收，去叶，晒干，或趁鲜切片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-actzxnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-actzxnn","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈长圆柱形，少有分枝，长短不一，直径0.5～1.5cm。表面灰黄色或黄褐色，有多数黄褐色点状皮孔及细纵纹，并有灰白色略呈半圆形的叶痕和黄棕色的腋芽。质坚韧，不易折断，断面纤维性。切片厚0.2～0.5cm，皮部较薄，木部黄白色，射线放射状，髓部白色或黄白色。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-tt4e2jz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-tt4e2jz","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】本品粉末灰黄色。纤维较多，成束或散在，淡黄色或无色，略弯曲，直径10～30μm，壁厚5～15μm，弯曲处呈皱襞，孔沟不明显，胞腔甚细。石细胞淡黄色，呈类圆形、类方形，直径15～40μm，壁厚5～20μm，胞腔小。含晶厚壁细胞成群或散在，形状、大小与石细胞近似，胞腔内含草酸钙方晶1～2个。草酸钙方晶存在于厚壁细胞中或散在，呈多面体或正方形、萎形、类双锥形，直径5～20μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-g63t263","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-g63t263","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-x2976pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-x2976pg","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑枝：未切片者，洗净，润透，切厚片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-e3ax6jl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-e3ax6jl","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炒桑枝：取桑枝片，照清炒法（附录ⅡD）炒至微黄色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-62d3kso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-62d3kso","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】微苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-x3n5wgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-x3n5wgp","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-n3rp5f9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-n3rp5f9","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风湿，利关节。用于肩臂、关节酸痛麻木。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-6e0whue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-6e0whue","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】9～15g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-hs98uca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-hs98uca","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-rlv9yuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-rlv9yuy","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】（1）用于风湿痹痛，常与防己、威灵仙、羌活、独活等配合应用；本品善走上肢，尤以治肩背酸痛，经络不利为常用，可单位熬膏服或与祛风湿药配伍使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-ilf4qhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-ilf4qhc","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-qb377ir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-qb377ir","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑枝《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-x1uu40n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-x1uu40n","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-rajp706","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-rajp706","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】SānɡZhī"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-m8ag5t1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-m8ag5t1","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】桑条（《本草图经》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-c00olyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-c00olyf","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为桑科植物桑的嫩枝。春末夏初采收，去叶，略晒，趁新鲜时切成长30～60厘米的段或斜片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-v4s167a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-v4s167a","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】全国大部分地区均产；主产江苏、浙扛、安徽、湖南、河北、四川等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-joails3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-joails3","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥的嫩枝呈长圆柱形，长短不一，直径0.5～1厘米。外表灰黄色或灰褐色，有多数淡褐色小点状皮孔及细纵纹，并可见灰白色半月形的叶痕和棕黄色的叶芽。质坚韧，有弹性，较难折断，断面黄白色，纤维性。斜片呈椭圆形，长约2毫米。切面皮部较薄，木部黄白色，射纹细密，中心有细小而绵软的髓。有青草气，味淡略粘。以质嫩、断面黄白色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-vsomw6d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-vsomw6d","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】桑枝含鞣质，游离的蔗糖、果糖、水苏糖、葡萄糖、麦芽糖、棉子糖、阿拉伯糖、木糖。茎含黄酮成分桑素、桑色烯、环桑素、环桑色烯。木材含桑色素、柘树宁、桑酮、四羟基芪、二氢桑色素、二氢山柰酚。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-e30z1xw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-e30z1xw","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】桑枝：拣去杂质，洗净，用水浸泡，润透后，切段，晒干。炒桑枝：取净桑枝段，置锅内用文火炒至淡黄色，放凉。另法加麸皮拌炒成深黄色，筛去麸皮，放凉。（每桑枝段100斤，用麸皮20斤）酒桑枝：取桑枝段用酒喷匀，置锅内炒至微黄色，放凉。（每桑枝段100斤，用酒15斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-ulshuxg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-ulshuxg","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-t0n65v6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-t0n65v6","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-jp13w8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-jp13w8l","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草图经》：\"平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-dju0e0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-dju0e0w","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"苦，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-9l2p3c7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-9l2p3c7","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《医林纂要》：\"甘辛，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-0pgsudj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-0pgsudj","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草再新》：\"味清苦，微寒，无毒。\"\"桑头：味苦，性寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-egjktx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-egjktx2","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-v6eo4et","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-v6eo4et","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-ingpaci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-ingpaci","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《得配本草》：\"入手太阴经。’"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-95e3fse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-95e3fse","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草再新》：\"入肺、肾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-lhsutlc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-lhsutlc","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草撮要》：\"入手、足太阴经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-p7icj5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-p7icj5p","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-phwn9qr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-phwn9qr","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"祛风湿，利关节，行水气。治风寒湿痹，四肢拘挛，脚气浮肿，肌体风痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-5r64shg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-5r64shg","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草图经》：\"疗遍体风痒干燥，脚气风气，四肢拘挛，上气，眼晕，肺气嗽，消食；利小便，兼疗口干。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-jl01z2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-jl01z2c","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草蒙筌》：\"利喘嗽逆气，消焮肿毒痈。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-ln8j02q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-ln8j02q","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草汇言》：\"去风气挛痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-w1xfkf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-w1xfkf9","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草备要》：\"利关节，养津液，行水祛风。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-r5sig66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-r5sig66","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《玉楸药解》：\"治中风歪斜，咳嗽。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-qygq3gs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-qygq3gs","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草再新》：\"壮肺气，燥湿，滋肾水，通经，止咳除烦，消肿止痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-4x6gehe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-4x6gehe","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《岭南采药录》：\"去骨节风疾，治老年鹤膝风。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-b4ylakp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-b4ylakp","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《现代实用中药》：\"嫩枝及叶熬膏服，治高血压，手足麻木。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-99201yx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-99201yx","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～2两；或熬膏。外用：煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-s8f8gz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-s8f8gz4","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-5r8pyod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-5r8pyod","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治臂痛：桑枝一小升。细切，炒香，以水三大升，煎取二升，一日服尽，无时。（《本事方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-r7lsola","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-r7lsola","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治水气脚气：桑条二两。炒香，以水一升，煎二合，每日空心服之。（《圣济总录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-v6hrb2h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-v6hrb2h","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治高血压：桑枝、桑叶、茺蔚子各五钱。加水1000毫升，煎成600毫升。睡前洗脚30～40分钟，洗完睡觉。（辽宁《中草药新医疗法展览会资料选编》双桑降压汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-f8vgpzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-f8vgpzr","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治紫癜风：桑枝十斤（锉），益母草三斤（锉）。上药，以水五斗，慢火煎至五升，滤去渣，入小铛内，熬为膏。每夜卧时，用温酒调服半合。（《圣惠方》桑枝煎）"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-ez1lseo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-ez1lseo","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】《本草撮要》：\"桑枝，功专去风湿拘挛，得桂枝治肩臂痹痛；得槐枝、柳枝、桃枝洗遍身痒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-ir51wdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-ir51wdr","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-owg1eji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-owg1eji","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桑枝《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-0i3w6bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-0i3w6bc","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-b2dw1w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-b2dw1w4","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】SānɡZhī"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-n4qpgtc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-n4qpgtc","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】桑条"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-dsy7sno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-dsy7sno","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-f8q3gbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-f8q3gbv","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为桑科植物桑的嫩枝。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-vabryxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-vabryxh","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：MorusalbaL."}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-qe8uwzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-qe8uwzy","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：春未、夏初采收，去叶，略晒，趁新鲜时切成长30～60cm的段或斜片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-nr6sq00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-nr6sq00","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】落叶灌木或小乔木，高3-15m。树皮灰白色，有条状浅裂；根皮黄棕色或红黄色，纤维性强。单叶互生；叶柄长l-2.5cm；叶片卵形或宽卵形，长5-20cm，宽4-10cm，先端锐尖或渐尖，基部圆形或近心形，边缘有粗锯齿或圆齿，有时有不规则的分裂，上面无毛，有光泽，下面脉上有短毛，腋间有毛，基出脉3条与细脉交织成网状，背面较明显；托叶披针形，早落。花单性，雌雄异株；雌、雄花序均排列成穗状葇荑花序，腋生；雌花序长l-2cm，被毛，总花梗长5-10mm；雄花序长1-2.5cm，下垂，略被细毛；雄花具花被片4，雄蕊4，中央有不育的雌蕊；雌花具花被片4，基部合生，柱头2裂。瘦果，多数密集成一卵圆形或长圆形的聚合果，长l-2.5cm，初时绿色，成熟后变肉质、黑紫色或红色。种子小。花期4-5月，果期5-6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-5zmv34a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-5zmv34a","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-adw0hhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-adw0hhm","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于丘陵、山坡、村旁、田野等处，多为人工栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-1ialvh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-1ialvh6","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于全国各地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-xdlhgxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-xdlhgxh","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-fyf5fvo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-fyf5fvo","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别嫩枝呈长圆柱形，少有分枝，长短不一，直径0.5-1.5cm。表面灰黄色或黄褐色，有多数黄褐色点状皮孔及细纵纹，并有灰白色略呈半圆形的叶痕和黄棕色腋芽。质坚韧，不易折断；断面纤维性。切片厚0.2-0.5cm，皮部较薄，木部黄白色，射线放射状，髓部白色或黄白色。气微，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-nrl65ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-nrl65ox","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以质嫩、断面黄白色者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-cxl0yxh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-cxl0yxh","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别粉末特征：灰黄色。①纤维较多，成束或单个散在，多缠结，淡黄色或无色。甚长，略弯曲，直径8-33μm，壁厚4-15μm，非木化，胞腔甚细。②石细胞多成群，淡黄色或黄色呈类圆形、椭圆形或类方形，直径13-39μm，少数长至70μm，壁厚6-20μm，层纹有的明显，孔沟较明显并分枝，胞腔细小。另有石细胞壁较薄。③含晶厚壁细胞多成群或单个散在。形状、大小与石细胞近似，胞腔内含草酸钙方晶1-2个。④草酸钙方晶存在于厚壁细胞中或散在，直径5-20μm。⑤木射线为异型细胞射线，壁连珠状增厚，纹孔较细密。⑥木纤维多成束，常与木射线细胞连结。呈长梭形，末端尾尖，直径12-20μm，壁厚约2μm，纹孔稀少，孔沟不明显。⑦导管主要为具缘纹孔导管。⑧乳汁管偶见，直径10-25（-30）μm，内含微细颗粒状分泌物。品质标志（中华人民共和国药典）1995年版规定：本品用热浸法测定，乙醇浸出物不得少于3.0％。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-rj3yelt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-rj3yelt","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】桑枝含鞣质（tannin）[1]，蔗糖（sucrose），果糖（fructose），水苏糖（stachyose），葡萄糖（glucose），麦芽糖（maltose），棉子糖（raffinose），阿拉伯糖（arabinose），木糖（xylose）[2]；茎含黄酮类成分：桑素（mulberrin），桑色烯（mulbel-rochromene），环桑素（cyclomulberrin），环桑色烯（cyclomulbel-rochromene）[3]。木材含桑色素（morin），柘树素（cudranin）[4，5]，2，4，4′，6-四羟基二苯甲酮（2，4，4′，6-tetrahydroxybenzoph-none)，2，3′，4，4′，6-五羟基二苯甲酮（2，3′，4，4′，6-pentahydrox-ybenzophenone，maclurin）[5]；心材含二氢桑色素（dihydromo-rin），二氢山柰酚（dihydrokaempferol），2，4，3′，5′-四羟基芪（2，4，3′，5′-tetrahydroxystilbene)[6]，白桑八醇（alboctalol）[7]。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-3h4xgc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-3h4xgc2","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】桑枝：拣去杂质，洗净，用水浸泡，润透后，切段，晒干。炒桑枝：取净桑枝段，置锅内用文火炒至淡黄色，放凉。另法加麸皮拌炒成深黄色，筛去麸皮，放凉。(每桑枝段100斤，用麸皮20斤)酒桑枝：取桑枝段用酒喷匀，置锅内炒至微黄色，放凉。(每桑枝段100斤，用酒15斤)"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-q8d98b2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-q8d98b2","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦；性平"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-iw19g7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-iw19g7k","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-855z7to","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-855z7to","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风湿；通经络；行水气。主风湿痹痛；中风半身不遂；水肿脚气；肌体风痒"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-ll4yjew","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-ll4yjew","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，15～30g。外用：适量，煎水熏洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-xgmhlwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-xgmhlwq","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】①治臂痛：桑枝一小升。细切，炒香，以水三大升，煎取二升，一日服尽，无时。(《本事方》)②治水气脚气：桑条二两。炒香，以水一升，煎二合，每日空心服之。(《圣济总录》)③治高血压：桑枝、桑叶、芜蔚子各五钱。加水1000毫升，煎成600毫升。睡前洗脚30～40分钟，洗完睫觉。(辽宁建中草药新医疗法展览会资料选编》双桑降压汤)④治紫痈风：桑校十斤(挫)，益母草三斤(挫)。上药，以水五斗，慢火煎至五升，滤去渣，入小挡内，熬为膏。每夜卧时，用温酒调服半台。(名圣惠方》桑枝煎)"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-742i2dh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-742i2dh","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】《本草撮要》：桑枝，功专去风湿拘挛，得桂枝治肩臂痹痛；得槐枝、柳枝、桃枝洗遍身痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902092837-gilsvg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092837-gilsvg4","updated":"20240902092900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902092839-qmskeud","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902092839-qmskeud","updated":"20240902092900"}},{"ID":"20240902092840-pj86b4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902092840-pj86b4h","updated":"20240902092900"}}]}